  "stage_trace": {
    "P0": "Pure selected-LSI envelope/bus validation plus independently legal configured-HSI final tree; existing time-driver preflight remains before singleton/MMIO.",
    "P1": "Selected target alone captures immutable entry state before LSE helpers; one native LSI and HSI factory halfword read; full AWT owner and existing RTC/AWT/HSE/LVD blockers preserved.",
    "P2": "Conservative Flash and monotonic /4 AHB /8 APB minimum guards retain entry source; full normalized CR0 expected acknowledgement precedes preparation.",
    "P3": "Cold matching and mismatching TRIM both require two equal complete consumer/global passes and request-edge comparison; only needed native TRIM is modified, preserving WAIT/reserved identity.",
    "P4": "First source request jointly sets permanent LSIEN and HSIEN before escape; full normalized CR1, LSI parameters/IER and dual ready views are checked; readiness sticks and events may rise only after the request for cold entry.",
    "P5": "Existing HSI calibration bridge has target/owner checks before temporary LSI and HSI stop; typed HSI/source expected advances only; permanent target cannot take restore-off tail.",
    "P6": "Retained HSE owner requires exact ready source/pads; deliberate HSE setup advances only native parameter/enables and projected GPIOF gate8. F8U6 has no owned HSE route.",
    "P7": "Existing auxiliary LSE helper is bracketed by complete target checks while HSI/guarded buses remain active; fresh default-register write is modeled exactly, reused source is unchanged, GPIOC gates restore, no selected-LSE marker.",
    "P8": "Final owner/pad/source/consumer proof precedes explicitly selected configured HSI under final buses; conservative Flash persists through the divider change.",
    "P9": "Final WAIT covers max(LSI upper HCLK, retained-HSI upper HCLK); final SYSCLK-only LSI write is last oscillator/source/divider write; all final proofs and Flash precede last CR0 read and publication."
  },
